<title>USA: Living Centers completes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Living Centers completes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Living Centers of America Inc said Tuesday it had completed its previously announced stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>Between July 24 and September 6 the company bought $20 million of its common stock at an average price of $25.78 a share, the company said.</p>
<p>The shares repurchased are primarily intended to be used over the next several years to fulfill obligations under the company's employee benefit plans.</p>
</text>
